# /init

Runs the `init-project` skill to profile the codebase and set up initial configuration.

## Usage

```bash
/init
```

## What It Does
1. Profiles the project codebase (language, framework, dependencies)
2. Generates or updates `CLAUDE.md` with project context
3. Sets up initial directory structure if needed
4. Links to the `init-project` skill in `skills/init-project/SKILL.md`